ext":"Batches not yet read wait in a buffer of the newest "},{"code":"capacity","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" batches; a slower reader"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"misses the older ones, and reads "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/InMemoryDestination\/records","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" for what is kept. The sequence ends once the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"destination and every copy of it are gone and every batch kept has been read."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"One task reads the batches at a time; it can fan each one out to the rest of the app. The"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"first iterator to read holds them until its iteration ends or it is released; a second"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reader meanwhile waits its turn, logging a warning once, then reads on from the next batch,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so the first gets every batch in order. A reader cancelled while it waits returns "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"abstract":[{"text":"Each batch as it is received, whole, for a reader that waits for a delivery: a view that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"refreshes, or a test that reads once a batch arrives.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/destinations\/inmemorydestination\/deliveries"]}],"sections":[],"references":{"doc://Destinations/documentation/Destinations/InMemoryDestination/records":{"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The records kept, in the order received, across batches."}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"records","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text